**Claim 1**

An autofocus device comprising:

an image sensor having a plurality of pixels including a plurality of focus detection pixels arranged to receive light fluxes passing through mutually different pupil regions of an imaging optical system, the image sensor being configured to output an image signal and a pair of focus detection signals;

a recognition unit configured to recognize a characteristic of a subject image based on the image signal output from the image sensor;

a storage unit configured to store a plurality of focus detection methods, each of the plurality of focus detection methods defining a manner of performing a phase-difference detection using the pair of focus detection signals;

a selection unit configured to select, from among the plurality of focus detection methods, an optimal focus detection method in accordance with the characteristic of the subject image recognized by the recognition unit;

a focus detection unit configured to detect a defocus amount by calculating a phase difference between the pair of focus detection signals in accordance with the optimal focus detection method selected by the selection unit; and

a control unit configured to drive a focus lens of the imaging optical system based on the defocus amount detected by the focus detection unit.

**Claim 1.**

An image sensor comprising:

a plurality of light receiving elements configured to receive light and generate image signals;

a plurality of micro-lenses disposed over the plurality of light receiving elements, each micro-lens being arranged to direct incident light onto a corresponding one of the light receiving elements;

a defocus detection unit configured to perform defocus detection based on the image signals generated by the plurality of light receiving elements;

a recognition unit configured to recognize one or more features of a subject image from the image signals; and

a focus control unit configured to optimize focusing based on the defocus detection and the one or more recognized features of the subject image.
